  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. Patching sketch_embeddings._load_embedding_model with a fake encoder and calling sketch._extract_config_embedding twice on a 2-file fixture gives encode batches [41, 127, 5, 12, 41, 127, 5, 12]. ANSWER_PATTERNS and BIG_PICTURE_QUESTIONS are encoded live at sketch.py:1867/1872, and NEGATIVE_PATTERNS at about 1964. _get_answer_probe_embeddings and _get_bigpic_probe_embeddings have no caller in src, tests or scripts. sketch.py and sketch_embeddings.py keep equal but separate copies of the lists (41 and 127 entries). MECHANISM: Precomputed probe embeddings are generated and shipped, but the consumer encodes the probe lists live; the getters have no caller. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fidan."  # ddf0
